---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Member directory
permalink: /members/
metaDescription: The Covenant Family Church member directory, for members of the church.
---
{# Sign-in and download run in members.js against Supabase (site.json → members).
   No data-pagefind-body here, so search doesn't index this page. #}
<header class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap"><h1>Member directory</h1></div>
</header>
<div class="wrap page-body">
  <article class="prose">
    {% set m = site.members %}
    {% if m.supabaseUrl and m.supabaseKey %}
    <p>The church directory is for members of Covenant Family Church. Sign in with the email address the church has for you, and we will email you a code. There is no password to remember.</p>
    <div class="members" data-url="{{ m.supabaseUrl }}" data-key="{{ m.supabaseKey }}" data-bucket="{{ m.bucket }}" data-file="{{ m.file }}" data-download-name="{{ m.downloadName }}">
      <form class="contact-form members-email">
        <p class="field">
          <label for="m-email">Your email address</label>
          <input id="m-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required>
        </p>
        <p><button class="button button-solid" type="submit">Email me a sign-in code</button></p>
      </form>
      <form class="contact-form members-code" hidden>
        <p class="field">
          <label for="m-code">Code from the email</label>
          <input id="m-code" name="code" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="one-time-code" pattern="[0-9]{6,10}" maxlength="10" required>
        </p>
        <p class="button-row">
          <button class="button button-solid" type="submit">Sign in</button>
          <button class="button" type="button" data-action="restart">Use a different email</button>
        </p>
      </form>
      <div class="members-in" hidden>
        <p>Signed in as <strong class="members-who"></strong>.</p>
        <p class="button-row">
          <button class="button button-solid" type="button" data-action="download">Download the directory (PDF)</button>
          <button class="button" type="button" data-action="signout">Sign out</button>
        </p>
        <p>Please keep the directory within the church: don’t forward it or post it anywhere.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
    <p>New to the church, or no code arriving? <a href="/contact/">Contact the pastor</a> to have your email added to the member list.</p>
    {% else %}
    <p>The member directory is not available online yet. Please ask the pastor for a copy.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </article>
</div>
<script src="/assets/js/members.js" defer></script>
